## <a id="english">English</a>

### 1. Purpose

We welcome security vulnerability reports from the community to improve product safety.

### 2. Reporting Process

Please report through GitHub Security Advisories or contact maintainers through the designated security channel.

### 3. Information to Include

Reports should include:

- Description of the vulnerability
- Reproduction steps
- Environment affected
- Estimated severity
- Proposed remediation if available

### 4. Handling Principles

- Do not publicly disclose vulnerabilities on public issues
- Do not exploit or disrupt user systems
- Do not share sensitive data publicly

### 5. Response Expectations

We will review and respond within a reasonable time. If the report is valid, we will prioritize a fix and release a patch when appropriate.
